# Frisket web build-time config (Vite) — LOCAL DEV ONLY. Copy to `web/.env.local`
# (gitignored via `*.local`) and fill in real values. VITE_-prefixed vars are
# INLINED INTO THE CLIENT BUNDLE at build time.
#
# PRODUCTION does NOT use these: the hosted server injects the basemap config at
# runtime from the FRISKET_MAP_* settings in the root `.env.example`, so the key
# isn't baked into the public image and
# can rotate without a rebuild. These VITE_ vars are just the local-dev fallback
# MapView uses when the runtime window.__FRISKET_MAP_CONFIG__ is absent.
#
# Map basemap (deck.gl raster TileLayer):
# - VITE_FRISKET_MAP_TILE_URL_TEMPLATE is non-secret style/provider config. Use
#   {z}/{x}/{y} for tile coords and an optional {key} placeholder for the key.
# - VITE_FRISKET_MAP_API_KEY is substituted into the {key} placeholder. It is
#   exposed to the browser by design — protect it in the MapTiler dashboard by
#   RESTRICTING IT TO YOUR ORIGIN(S) (localhost + prod domain) and setting a
#   usage cap. Kept out of git so it is not harvested from the (open-source)
#   repo history. Set it in your CI/deploy build env too (Vite inlines at build).
VITE_FRISKET_MAP_TILE_URL_TEMPLATE=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets-v2/256/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key={key}
VITE_FRISKET_MAP_API_KEY=YOUR_MAPTILER_KEY
VITE_FRISKET_MAP_ATTRIBUTION=© MapTiler © OpenStreetMap contributors
